    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p><span>A Sustainable Future is a student-run, environmental nonprofit that is dedicated to creating a better future for our planet through a potent combination of advocacy, outreach, and content creation. The ASF Gallery features original artwork, poetry, and articles created by ASF's very own team of Research Directors. We invite you to explore the work of ASF's members and learn more about how we are working to create a brighter, more sustainable future.</span></p>"
